review_text:
This game looks like it's at a pretty fair price right ?

WRONG.

It is actually super expensive.

Cuz the second you finish the story, you will feel the irresistible urge to buy :
The most expensive skateboard you can find ; 
The biggest bluetooth speaker on the market ;
A huge load of spraypaint cans ; 
This banger OST...

All of that in order to zoom at full speed through your town trying to spraypaint busses and trains in motion while blasting this out-of this world soundtrack.

Yea this game's good, plus it got an hatsune miku mod that I'm really fond of.
